ass=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ok</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.59em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">INCONSISTENT</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[32]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{variant} & \\text{order n} & \\text{degrees} & \\text{\\#eqs} & \\text{\\#unk} & \\text{status}\\\\\\hline\\text{grow=}0 & 1 & \\left\\{0,1,4,5\\right\\} & 38 & 19 & \\text{INCONSISTENT}\\\\\\hline\\text{grow=}1 & 1 & \\left\\{1,2,5,6\\right\\} & 38 & 23 & \\text{ok}\\\\\\hline\\text{grow=}1 & 2 & \\left\\{2,3,6,7\\right\\} & 38 & 27 & \\text{ok}\\\\\\hline\\text{grow=}1 & 3 & \\left\\{3,4,7,8\\right\\} & 42 & 31 & \\text{INCONSISTENT}\\\\\\hline\\text{grow=}2 & 1 & \\left\\{2,3,6,7\\right\\} & 38 & 27 & \\text{ok}\\\\\\hline\\text{grow=}2 & 2 & \\left\\{4,5,8,9\\right\\} & 46 & 35 & \\text{INCONSISTENT}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
