  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 7. All four seeds at once, sharing one tau. THE fix over cell 6.\n   Control experiment that isolated the bug: feed the exactly known branch-1 solution of the\n   vacuum, Q_1 = Exp[I eps psi_1 u] (M_1 = 0 so q_1 = 1 identically), into BaxU. The equations are\n   then consistent to order eps^6, with exactly two undetermined tau directions per order\n   (tcn[1,n], tcn[2,n]). So the ansatz, tc0 and the unstripped operator are all sound, and the\n   failures in cell 6 came from setting leftover parameters to zero indiscriminately:\n       leftover Q-coefficients ARE gauge (add eps^n x a lower untwisted solution) -- zero them;\n       leftover tau coefficients are NOT -- tau is shared and physical, and zeroing it kills the\n       solution three or four orders later. They are carried symbolically instead, and the OTHER\n       branches fix them, which is the whole reason for solving the four seeds together. ---- *)\nClearAll[SeedSolveAll];\nSeedSolveAll[S_, P_, μ_, N_] := Module[{u0 = UntwSolve[S, P, μ], dh, x, Qf, tcser, R, acc = {}, rep = {}, eqs, unk, sol, frq, frt},\n   dh = u0[\"Mhat\"];\n   tcser = Table[tc[i] -> u0[\"tc0\"][[i]] + Sum[eps^n tcn[i, n], {n, N}], {i, 5}];\n   Qf[k_] := Function[y, Evaluate[qpoly[u0[\"P\"][[k]], y] + Sum[eps^n Sum[qn[k, j, n] y^j, {j, 0, dh[[k]] + n}], {n, N}]]];\n   R = Table[Expand[((BaxU[S, P, μ][Qf[k]][x] /. prm) /. zser[N]) /. tcser], {k, 4}];\n   Do[eqs = DeleteCases[Expand[Flatten[Table[CoefficientList[Coefficient[R[[k]], eps, n], x], {k, 4}]] /. acc], 0];\n      unk = Join[Table[tcn[i, n], {i, 5}], Flatten[Table[qn[k, j, n], {k, 4}, {j, 0, dh[[k]] + n}]]];\n      unk = Select[unk, FreeQ[If[acc === {}, {}, acc[[All, 1]]], #] &];\n      sol = Quiet@Solve[(# == 0 &) /@ eqs, unk];\n      If[sol === {}, rep = Append[rep, {n, Length[eqs], Length[unk], \"INCONSISTENT\", \"-\", \"-\"}]; Break[]];\n      frq = Cases[Complement[unk, First[sol][[All, 1]]], _qn];        (* gauge: zero it *)\n      frt = Cases[Complement[unk, First[sol][[All, 1]]], _tcn];       (* physical: carry it *)\n      rep = Append[rep, {n, Length[eqs], Length[unk], \"ok\", Length[frq], frt}];\n      acc = Join[Join[acc, First[sol]] /. Thread[frq -> 0], Thread[frq -> 0]], {n, N}];\n   <|\"report\" -> rep, \"sol\" -> acc, \"Qf\" -> Qf, \"Mhat\" -> dh|>];\n\nWith[{r = SeedSolveAll[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}, 4]},\n Grid[Prepend[r[\"report\"], {\"order n\", \"#eqs\", \"#unk\", \"status\", \"#gauge zeroed\", \"tau directions carried\"}], Frame -> All]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
