  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## `Bax[n][f]` — the Baxter operator to fixed twist order\n\n```\nSetState[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}];   (* sets S, P, mu and TC0 = untwisted tc *)\nBax[0][f]                        (* expression in u holding f[u+h], f[u], f[u-h], f[u-2h], f[u-3h] *)\nBax[2][f]                        (* same, truncated at eps^2 *)\n```\n\nPlug in a literal `f`. The result is an ordinary expression in the global `u`; it does nothing\nelse — no ansatz, no solving. A concrete function works too (`Bax[0][Function[y, y^2]]`).\n\nThe twist enters $\\tau_a$ in three places, and the first two are **exactly** known, so they are\nexpanded exactly instead of being carried as unknowns:\n\n$$[u^{2a}]\\,\\tau_a = \\chi_a\\ ,\\qquad [u^{2a-1}]\\,\\tau_a = -a\\,(\\theta_1+\\theta_2+(a-1)h)\\,\\chi_a - h\\,\\Xi_a\\ ,\\qquad \\Xi_a = \\sum_{|I|=a} z_I \\sum_{i\\in I} n_i = \\sum_i n_i z_i \\frac{\\partial \\chi_a}{\\partial z_i}\\ ,$$\n\nwith $n = \\mu$ the global Cartan weight, and $\\tau_4 = \\mathrm{qdet} = \\chi_4 \\prod_i \\nu_i(u-(4-i)h)$, where $\\chi_4 = 1$ on the unimodular ray.\n\nOnly the five genuinely free coefficients are unknown, each expanded as\n$\\mathrm{tc}[i] \\to \\mathrm{TC0}[i] + \\sum_{m=1}^{n} \\varepsilon^m\\, \\mathrm{tcn}[i,m]$, with `TC0` the untwisted values from\nthe solver above. `z_j = Exp[I eps psi_j]` is expanded to order `n+4`, so the truncation is clean\nat order `n`.\n\n**Front-end rule for this notebook:** keep every expression on ONE line, *comments included*. A\nline break starts a new statement, so a definition, a list, or a multi-line comment continued on\nthe next line is either silently truncated or reported as `Syntax::sntxi`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Bax[n][f] : Baxter operator applied to f, to order n in the twist; an expression in the global u holding f[u+h], f[u], f[u-h], f[u-2h], f[u-3h]. *)\nClearAll[SetState, Bax, tcSer, zSub, SS, PP, MU, TC0, u];\nSetState[S_, P_, μ_] := (SS = S; PP = P; MU = μ; TC0 = UntwSolve[S, P, μ][\"tc0\"]; {\"state\" -> {S, P, μ}, \"tc0\" -> TC0});\nzSub[n_] := Table[z[j] -> Normal[Series[Exp[I eps psi[[j]]], {eps, 0, n}]], {j, 4}];\ntcSer[n_] := Table[tc[i] -> TC0[[i]] + Sum[eps^m tcn[i, m], {m, n}], {i, 5}];\nBax[n_][f_] := Normal[Series[Expand[(((Product[ν1[SS, PP][u - m h], {m, 0, 3}] f[u + h] - τ[1][SS, PP, MU][u] Product[ν1[SS, PP][u - m h], {m, 1, 3}] f[u] + τ[2][SS, PP, MU][u] Product[ν1[SS, PP][u - m h], {m, 2, 3}] f[u - h] - τ[3][SS, PP, MU][u] ν1[SS, PP][u - 3 h] f[u - 2 h] + τ[4][SS, PP, MU][u] f[u - 3 h]) /. prm) /. zSub[n + 4]) /. tcSer[n]], {eps, 0, n}]];\nSetState[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}];\n{\"shifts in Bax[0][f]\" -> Union[Cases[Bax[0][f], f[a_] :> a, Infinity]], \"Bax[0] kills every untwisted P_k\" -> Table[Simplify[Bax[0][Function[y, qpoly[UntwSolve[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}][\"P\"][[k]], y]]]] === 0, {k, 4}]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"251776\" data-output-id=\"3\" data-out-n=\"35\" data-sub-idx=\"7\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"9\" data-sub-start=\"7\" data-sub-end=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[35]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"16\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">shifts in Bax[0][f]</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Bax[0] kills every untwisted P_k</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[35]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\text{shifts in Bax[0][f]} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to \\left\\{u-3,u-2,u-1,u,u+1\\right\\} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{Bax[0] kills every untwisted P\\_k} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "121b8260-3765-469d-b996-ec06516ac66a"
    }
