  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* qs[k][S,P,mu][n,m][u] : branch k. Leading order = the untwisted P_k of cell 3, plus eps^1..eps^n, each an arbitrary polynomial of degree m with coefficients qc[k,j,i]. *)\nClearAll[qs, qc];\nqs[k_][S_, P_, μ_][n_, m_][x_] := qpoly[UntwSolve[S, P, μ][\"P\"][[k]], x] + Sum[eps^j Sum[qc[k, j, i] x^i, {i, 0, m}], {j, n}];\n{\"qs[2][1,1,{2,2,0,0}][2,3][u]\" -> qs[2][1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}][2, 3][u], \"leading orders, n=0\" -> Table[qs[k][1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}][0, 0][u], {k, 4}]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
