  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Plug qs into Bax. Order eps^0 must vanish for every branch; then solve order eps^1 for the transfer-matrix coefficients tcn[i,1] together with the branch coefficients qc[k,1,i]. Degree taken as deg P_k + 1. *)\nClearAll[mk, RR, lead0, eq1, unk1, sol1];\nSetState[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}];\nmk = UntwSolve[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}][\"Mhat\"] + 1;\nRR = Table[Bax[1][Function[y, qs[k][1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}][1, mk[[k]]][y]]], {k, 4}];\nlead0 = Table[Simplify[Coefficient[RR[[k]], eps, 0]] === 0, {k, 4}];\neq1 = DeleteCases[Expand[Flatten[Table[CoefficientList[Coefficient[RR[[k]], eps, 1], u], {k, 4}]]], 0];\nunk1 = Join[Table[tcn[i, 1], {i, 5}], Flatten[Table[qc[k, 1, i], {k, 4}, {i, 0, mk[[k]]}]]];\nsol1 = Solve[(# == 0 &) /@ eq1, unk1];\n{\"degrees m_k\" -> mk, \"eps^0 residual vanishes\" -> lead0, \"#eqs at eps^1\" -> Length[eq1], \"#unknowns\" -> Length[unk1], \"#solutions\" -> Length[sol1], \"tau at eps^1\" -> If[sol1 === {}, $Failed, Simplify[Table[tcn[i, 1], {i, 5}] /. First[sol1]]], \"left free\" -> If[sol1 === {}, $Failed, Complement[unk1, First[sol1][[All, 1]]]]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"vscode-wolfram-message-output\" style=\"color:#f44;border-left:3px solid #f44;background:rgba(255,68,68,0.08);padding:2px 6px;margin:1px 0;border-radius:0 3px 3px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:0.85em;white-space:pre-wrap\">Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all &quot;solve&quot; variables.</div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all \"solve\" variables.",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
