      {
       "data": "Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all \"solve\" variables.",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      },
      {
       "data": "{\n\t\"name\": \"WolframKernelMessage\",\n\t\"message\": \"Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all \\\"solve\\\" variables.\",\n\t\"stack\": \"\"\n}",
       "mime": "application/vnd.code.notebook.error"
      }
     ],
     "id": "d0af65a0-e1e2-48cd-82d3-ef705c47f070"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* One order at a time. At eps^j the branch polynomial has degree deg P_k + j (that growth is just Exp[phi u] written out). At each order solve for tcn[i,n] together with the qc[k,n,i]; lower orders are already numbers, so each step is a linear solve. zeroQ=True fixes the leftover branch freedom to zero before moving on, which keeps later orders linear; zeroQ=False carries it symbolically. *)\nClearAll[runOrders];\nrunOrders[S_, P_, μ_, N_, zeroQ_] := Module[{dh = UntwSolve[S, P, μ][\"Mhat\"], Pk = UntwSolve[S, P, μ][\"P\"], Qf, R, acc = {}, rep = {}, eqs, unk, sol, fr}, Qf[k_] := Function[y, Evaluate[qpoly[Pk[[k]], y] + Sum[eps^j Sum[qc[k, j, i] y^i, {i, 0, dh[[k]] + j}], {j, N}]]]; R = Table[Bax[N][Qf[k]], {k, 4}]; Do[eqs = DeleteCases[Expand[Flatten[Table[CoefficientList[Coefficient[R[[k]], eps, n], u], {k, 4}]] /. acc], 0]; unk = Select[Join[Table[tcn[i, n], {i, 5}], Flatten[Table[qc[k, n, i], {k, 4}, {i, 0, dh[[k]] + n}]]], FreeQ[If[acc === {}, {}, acc[[All, 1]]], #] &]; sol = Quiet@Solve[(# == 0 &) /@ eqs, unk]; If[sol === {}, rep = Append[rep, {n, Length[eqs], Length[unk], \"INCONSISTENT\", \"-\", \"-\"}]; Break[]]; fr = Complement[unk, First[sol][[All, 1]]]; rep = Append[rep, {n, Length[eqs], Length[unk], \"ok\", Length[fr], Simplify[Table[tcn[i, n], {i, 5}] /. First[sol]]}]; acc = If[zeroQ, Join[Join[acc, First[sol]] /. Thread[fr -> 0], Thread[fr -> 0]], Join[acc, First[sol]]], {n, N}]; rep];\nSetState[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}];\nGrid[Prepend[Join[Prepend[#, \"zero leftovers\"] & /@ runOrders[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}, 4, True], Prepend[#, \"carry leftovers\"] & /@ runOrders[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}, 4, False]], {\"variant\", \"order n\", \"#eqs\", \"#unk\", \"status\", \"#free\", \"tau at this order\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
