       "data": "Out[57]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\text{conditions from the negative orders} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to \\left\\{\\mathrm{av}\\left(-3\\right)+\\mathrm{bv}\\left(-3\\right) \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. ,\\mathrm{av}\\left(-2\\right)+\\mathrm{bv}\\left(-2\\right),\\mathrm{i}\\,\\mathrm{av}\\left(-3\\right) \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. +\\frac{1}{3}\\,\\mathrm{i}\\,\\mathrm{bv}\\left(-3\\right),\\mathrm{av}\\left(-1\\right)+\\mathrm{bv}\\left(-1\\right) \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. ,\\mathrm{i}\\,\\mathrm{av}\\left(-2\\right)+\\frac{1}{3}\\,\\mathrm{i}\\,\\mathrm{bv}\\left(-2\\right) \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. ,-\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathrm{av}\\left(-3\\right)-\\frac{\\mathrm{bv}\\left(-3\\right)}{18}\\right\\},\\text{solved} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to \\left\\{\\mathrm{av}\\left(-3\\right)\\to 0,\\mathrm{bv}\\left(-3\\right)\\to 0 \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. ,\\mathrm{av}\\left(-2\\right)\\to 0,\\mathrm{bv}\\left(-2\\right)\\to 0 \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. ,\\mathrm{bv}\\left(-1\\right)\\to -\\mathrm{av}\\left(-1\\right)\\right\\} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{eps\\^{}0 limit} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to \\frac{2}{3}\\,\\mathrm{i}\\,\\mathrm{av}\\left(-1\\right)\\,u+\\mathrm{av}\\left(0\\right)+\\mathrm{bv}\\left(0\\right) \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{de… [latex truncated: 1250 chars total]",
