  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* CHECK: feed the exponential branches and the regular combination back into Bax, with the tau determined at order eps^1. Q1 = Exp[phi1 u] and Q2 = Exp[phi2 u] are the exact branches here (q_1 = q_2 = 1), and Q2reg = a Q1 + b Q2 with b = -a must solve the same equation, divergent 1/eps piece included. *)\nClearAll[tcs1, Q1f, Q2f, Q2regf, chk];\ntcs1 = Thread[Table[tcn[i, 1], {i, 5}] -> {(124 I)/63, (416 I)/21, (-32384 I)/1323, (13312 I)/1323, (292 I)/63}];\nQ1f = Function[y, Exp[I eps psi[[1]] y]];\nQ2f = Function[y, Exp[I eps psi[[2]] y]];\nQ2regf = Function[y, Evaluate[(aser Exp[I eps psi[[1]] y] + bser Exp[I eps psi[[2]] y]) /. First[sol0]]];\nchk[f_] := Table[Simplify[Coefficient[Expand[Bax[1][f] /. tcs1], eps, n]] === 0, {n, -1, 1}];\n{\"orders checked\" -> {-1, 0, 1}, \"Bax[Q1]\" -> chk[Q1f], \"Bax[Q2]\" -> chk[Q2f], \"Bax[Q2reg]\" -> chk[Q2regf]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"251776\" data-output-id=\"8\" data-out-n=\"64\" data-sub-idx=\"7\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"16\" data-sub-start=\"7\" data-sub-end=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[64]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"16\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:7.5em;vertical-align:-3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4em;\"><span style=\"top:-6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.16em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">orders checked</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.66em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Bax[Q1]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.16em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Bax[Q2]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.66em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Bax[Q2reg]</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.16em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[64]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\text{orders checked}\\to \\left\\{-1,0,1\\right\\} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{Bax[Q1]}\\to \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{Bax[Q2]}\\to \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{Bax[Q2reg]} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "b6e423a3-255c-4e02-a0b1-b90a43e30781"
    }
