      {
       "data": "Out[78]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\text{\\#conditions}\\to 9,\\text{solved} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to \\left\\{a2v\\left(-3\\right)\\to -36\\,a1v\\left(-3\\right) \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. ,c1v\\left(-3\\right)\\to 0,c0v\\left(-3\\right) \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. \\to 35\\,a1v\\left(-3\\right),c1v\\left(-2\\right) \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. \\to 4\\,\\mathrm{i}\\,a1v\\left(-3\\right),c0v\\left(-2\\right)\\to \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. -a1v\\left(-2\\right)-a2v\\left(-2\\right),c1v\\left(-1\\right) \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. \\to -\\frac{4}{5}\\,\\mathrm{i}\\,a1v\\left(-2\\right)-\\frac{2}{15}\\,\\mathrm{i}\\,a2v\\left(-2\\right) \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. ,c0v\\left(-1\\right)\\to -a1v\\left(-1\\right)-a2v\\left(-1\\right)\\right\\} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{eps\\^{}0 limit}\\to \\frac{1}{225}\\, \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left(225\\,\\left(a1v\\left(0\\right)+a2v\\left(0\\right)+c0v\\left(0\\right)\\right) \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. +15\\,u\\,\\left(12\\,\\mathrm{i}\\,a1v\\left(-1\\right)+2\\,\\mathrm{i}\\,a2v\\left(-1\\right)+15\\,c1v\\left(0\\right)\\right)+u^2\\, \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. \\left(-72\\,a1v\\left(-2\\right)-2\\,a2v\\left(-2\\right)+225\\right) \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. -16\\,\\mathrm{i}\\,a… [latex truncated: 1301 chars total]",
